1
00:00:20,800 --> 00:00:22,700
(Silence; Operating Room Area)

2
00:00:39,680 --> 00:00:43,560
=Stand Up for Love=

3
00:00:43,720 --> 00:00:46,680
=Episode 1=

4
00:00:50,119 --> 00:00:51,039
(Zhang Haotian.)

5
00:00:51,200 --> 00:00:52,119
(I've already altered
the donation agreement for you.)

6
00:00:52,119 --> 00:00:53,479
(I've already altered
the donation agreement for you.)

7
00:00:53,479 --> 00:00:55,159
(The psychiatric hospital is arranged.)

8
00:00:55,640 --> 00:00:57,039
(You took Miss Jiang's kidney)

9
00:00:57,039 --> 00:00:58,960
(and tricked the Lin family's
heiress into marrying you.)

10
00:00:59,520 --> 00:01:01,560
(You promised you'd pay off
my gambling debts.)

11
00:01:01,560 --> 00:01:02,320
(Jiang Lai, a dance prodigy betrayed
in love and robbed of her kidney)

12
00:01:02,320 --> 00:01:03,359
(So when are you giving me the money?)

13
00:01:03,399 --> 00:01:05,000
(If we don't get rid of her,)

14
00:01:05,079 --> 00:01:06,519
(we're both going down with her.)

15
00:01:07,720 --> 00:01:08,519
(Zhang Haotian, a heartless man who used
marriage to steal Jiang Lai's kidney)

16
00:01:08,519 --> 00:01:10,640
(He's my fiance,)

17
00:01:10,840 --> 00:01:12,000
(Zhang Haotian.)

18
00:01:12,879 --> 00:01:15,879
(Jiang Lai, will you marry me?)

19
00:01:17,239 --> 00:01:19,519
(I'll spend my whole life
protecting you.)

20
00:01:21,079 --> 00:01:22,200
(On the eve of our wedding,)

21
00:01:22,200 --> 00:01:23,719
(he was diagnosed with uremia.)

22
00:01:23,840 --> 00:01:25,239
(I was a perfect match for him.)

23
00:01:26,439 --> 00:01:28,480
(Party B's Thumbprint: Jiang Lai)
(I gave him one of my kidneys.)

24
00:01:29,840 --> 00:01:30,640
(But he...)

25
00:01:31,319 --> 00:01:32,920
(was a liar.)

26
00:01:39,319 --> 00:01:41,599
(This man is his accomplice.)

27
00:01:44,879 --> 00:01:46,359
(For their own selfish gain,)

28
00:01:46,360 --> 00:01:47,920
(Chen Ping, the corrupt doctor
who removed Jiang Lai's kidney)

29
00:01:48,159 --> 00:01:49,640
(they conspired against me.)

30
00:01:50,920 --> 00:01:52,439
(They didn't just steal my kidney.)

31
00:01:52,439 --> 00:01:53,840
(Organ Transport Container)
(They wanted me to go forever)

32
00:01:56,079 --> 00:01:58,000
(and deliberately framed me
as mentally unstable.)

33
00:02:00,760 --> 00:02:02,640
(Once she's locked away
in a psychiatric hospital,)

34
00:02:02,959 --> 00:02:04,280
(she'll never get out.)

35
00:02:04,959 --> 00:02:06,280
(Then the problem will take care
of itself.)

36
00:02:07,280 --> 00:02:08,159
(Zhang Haotian.)

37
00:02:09,080 --> 00:02:10,319
(You destroyed my life.)

38
00:02:11,479 --> 00:02:13,080
(I'll send you straight to hell.)

39
00:02:14,080 --> 00:02:15,240
(I have to survive.)

40
00:02:15,960 --> 00:02:17,319
(I have to get revenge!)

41
00:02:35,360 --> 00:02:36,720
(Has anyone ever experienced)

42
00:02:36,720 --> 00:02:38,560
(falling from heaven straight
into hell?)

43
00:02:40,080 --> 00:02:40,919
(I have.)

44
00:02:41,680 --> 00:02:44,639
(Because right now, I'm in hell.)

45
00:02:46,360 --> 00:02:47,680
(My name is Jiang Lai.)

46
00:02:47,680 --> 00:02:50,000
(I was a gifted dancer who belonged
on center stage.)

47
00:02:51,639 --> 00:02:53,520
(The person I loved most)

48
00:02:53,599 --> 00:02:55,439
(destroyed my dreams
and buried my entire life)

49
00:02:56,319 --> 00:02:57,879
(with his own hands.)

50
00:03:03,600 --> 00:03:06,640
(Private Hospital; Outpatient Department)

51
00:03:11,120 --> 00:03:13,240
Mai, when did you come back?

52
00:03:14,000 --> 00:03:15,319
If I hadn't returned,

53
00:03:15,639 --> 00:03:17,599
you'd have lost your life.

54
00:03:20,080 --> 00:03:21,280
(Zhao Mai, Jiang Lai's best friend,
a wealthy returnee)

55
00:03:21,280 --> 00:03:22,680
I know what happened.

56
00:03:24,240 --> 00:03:25,759
What can I do to help?

57
00:03:28,039 --> 00:03:29,879
I want revenge.

58
00:03:33,039 --> 00:03:34,199
Shouldn't we call the police first?

59
00:03:36,680 --> 00:03:37,479
No.

60
00:03:38,840 --> 00:03:40,879
I want to send him to hell myself.

61
00:03:41,719 --> 00:03:43,400
Then I'll help you make it happen.

62
00:03:43,840 --> 00:03:46,199
I'll make everyone who hurt you
pay the price.

63
00:03:47,479 --> 00:03:48,479
Right now,

64
00:03:49,879 --> 00:03:53,360
he must be using my kidney
to climb into wealth and power.

65
00:04:03,159 --> 00:04:04,039
I looked into it.

66
00:04:04,039 --> 00:04:07,199
(Su Qinglan, Jingzhou's richest woman)
Su suffered kidney failure for 3 years.

67
00:04:07,199 --> 00:04:08,919
(Lin Lulu's mother)
She just underwent a kidney transplant.

68
00:04:09,039 --> 00:04:10,759
(Lin Lulu, a wealthy heiress)
And she's Lin Lulu's mother.

69
00:04:11,919 --> 00:04:12,960
(I love you, Lin Lulu!)
Then there's no doubt.

70
00:04:12,960 --> 00:04:15,639
Lin Lulu is Zhang Haotian's new target.

71
00:04:15,879 --> 00:04:18,439
He's using my kidney as his ticket
into the Lin family

72
00:04:18,600 --> 00:04:20,160
to steal their fortune.

73
00:04:24,879 --> 00:04:25,959
From today on,

74
00:04:25,959 --> 00:04:26,920
Jiang Lai is dead.

75
00:04:27,800 --> 00:04:29,199
I'll take on a new identity

76
00:04:29,639 --> 00:04:30,800
and a new face.

77
00:04:31,240 --> 00:04:32,759
I'll arrange the surgery immediately.

78
00:04:48,120 --> 00:04:48,839
(Day 1)

79
00:04:48,839 --> 00:04:50,000
(From now on,)

80
00:04:50,800 --> 00:04:52,240
(my name is Zhao Ke.)

81
00:04:53,480 --> 00:04:54,920
(My new identity)

82
00:04:55,199 --> 00:04:56,360
(and new face)

83
00:04:56,600 --> 00:04:59,000
(were made specifically for you,
Zhang Haotian.)

84
00:04:59,879 --> 00:05:00,800
(My dream of dancing,)

85
00:05:00,800 --> 00:05:02,120
(my life,)

86
00:05:02,600 --> 00:05:03,680
(my kidney...)

87
00:05:04,160 --> 00:05:06,399
(I'll make you pay back every bit,
with interest.)

88
00:05:08,760 --> 00:05:09,760
(Day 73)

89
00:05:10,000 --> 00:05:16,760
(Two Months Later)

90
00:05:23,200 --> 00:05:25,040
(Zhao Ke, Level One / Senior
Beauty Technician)

91
00:05:25,600 --> 00:05:26,959
(My scars became my soil,)

92
00:05:27,800 --> 00:05:29,000
(my struggles forged my strength,)

93
00:05:29,759 --> 00:05:32,879
(and from the depths of despair,
I bloomed stronger than ever.)

94
00:05:35,160 --> 00:05:37,960
(Lin Family Villa)

95
00:05:38,600 --> 00:05:39,560
How did it go?

96
00:05:40,839 --> 00:05:41,759
Don't worry.

97
00:05:42,240 --> 00:05:43,399
I saw Jiang Lai being cremated

98
00:05:43,399 --> 00:05:45,120
at the funeral home.

99
00:05:45,720 --> 00:05:48,279
It's better she's dead.
Then it's all over.

100
00:05:48,800 --> 00:05:51,000
But my mother-in-law still
doesn't trust me.

101
00:05:51,360 --> 00:05:53,560
I signed a prenuptial
property agreement.

102
00:05:53,800 --> 00:05:55,439
I'm nothing but an outsider now.

103
00:05:55,439 --> 00:05:57,279
I can't touch a single cent
of the Lin family's fortune.

104
00:05:57,279 --> 00:05:58,399
Then what do we do?

105
00:05:58,720 --> 00:06:00,800
We can't let all our work go to waste.

106
00:06:01,279 --> 00:06:02,959
If Madam Lin were gone,

107
00:06:03,360 --> 00:06:06,079
everything in the Lin family
would belong to me.

108
00:06:07,079 --> 00:06:09,199
Alright. I'll figure something out.

109
00:06:24,880 --> 00:06:28,160
(Luna.S Beauty Salon)

110
00:06:29,680 --> 00:06:33,920
Word has it that a top beauty technician
has returned from overseas.

111
00:06:34,519 --> 00:06:36,439
And her services are priceless.

112
00:06:37,040 --> 00:06:38,240
(Lin Lulu.)

113
00:06:38,360 --> 00:06:39,240
(It's you.)

114
00:06:39,759 --> 00:06:41,600
(You live comfortably,)

115
00:06:41,839 --> 00:06:43,480
(enjoying everything my kidney
bought you.)

116
00:06:46,480 --> 00:06:48,639
(While I was fighting for my life
in the hospital,)

117
00:06:50,319 --> 00:06:51,800
(you were out there living it up.)

118
00:06:53,240 --> 00:06:55,560
(But you're just another
one of his victims.)

119
00:06:57,000 --> 00:07:00,040
(And you're the first step
in my revenge.)

120
00:07:02,360 --> 00:07:03,920
I'm not as impressive as people say.

121
00:07:03,920 --> 00:07:05,480
Hello, Miss Lin.

122
00:07:08,199 --> 00:07:10,639
I wear gloves to keep my hands
at the right temperature.

123
00:07:10,879 --> 00:07:14,000
I've also prepared a hot water bottle
and an ice bucket for you,

124
00:07:14,279 --> 00:07:15,879
so you can adjust the temperature
whenever you need.

125
00:07:15,879 --> 00:07:18,079
You really thought of everything.

126
00:07:28,000 --> 00:07:29,399
You're blocking my view.

127
00:07:29,879 --> 00:07:33,480
You want to serve me, yet you dare
give me that look?

128
00:07:34,199 --> 00:07:36,720
(There's one more thing
I need to remind you.)

129
00:07:37,000 --> 00:07:38,560
(In Lin Lulu's eyes,)

130
00:07:39,319 --> 00:07:41,120
(people are divided
into different classes.)

131
00:07:42,480 --> 00:07:43,839
(So you'd better be prepared.)

132
00:07:50,240 --> 00:07:51,279
I'm sorry, Miss Lin.

133
00:07:51,279 --> 00:07:52,399
It was my mistake.

134
00:07:52,439 --> 00:07:53,959
I'll make sure to take good care of you.

135
00:08:04,560 --> 00:08:07,879
You do have a rather cold
and aloof look.

136
00:08:08,079 --> 00:08:10,160
I thought you were above
all worldly desires.

137
00:08:11,120 --> 00:08:12,560
But I never expected

138
00:08:13,000 --> 00:08:15,959
you'd be even more skilled
than my usual beauty technicians.

139
00:08:17,920 --> 00:08:19,959
(Once I tear off Zhang Haotian's mask,)

140
00:08:20,439 --> 00:08:23,839
(your arrogance will be worth nothing.)

141
00:08:24,480 --> 00:08:26,480
(Rebirth)

142
00:08:27,480 --> 00:08:31,360
♪Listen, the wind chimes softly whisper♪

143
00:08:31,440 --> 00:08:34,240
♪I should forget you♪

144
00:08:35,080 --> 00:08:39,480
♪But I have the will,
yet not the strength♪

145
00:08:39,920 --> 00:08:41,440
♪To carry on♪

146
00:08:42,320 --> 00:08:46,680
♪The scenery you once longed to see♪

147
00:08:47,440 --> 00:08:50,360
♪You no longer have the strength♪

148
00:08:51,800 --> 00:08:55,160
♪You want me to go there for you♪

149
00:08:56,000 --> 00:09:01,320
♪I look up and see a hollow sky♪

150
00:09:01,640 --> 00:09:05,480
♪Your freedom♪

151
00:09:06,160 --> 00:09:10,960
♪Has become my cage♪

152
00:09:11,680 --> 00:09:17,760
♪My hand brushes over your smile
in the photograph♪

153
00:09:18,080 --> 00:09:23,880
♪This glass of wine is filled
with sorrow♪

154
00:09:25,200 --> 00:09:31,280
♪I look up at the beautiful night sky♪

155
00:09:31,320 --> 00:09:34,160
♪You told me♪

156
00:09:34,160 --> 00:09:39,320
♪I would shine like a star♪

157
00:09:40,400 --> 00:09:44,360
♪But you forgot to teach me♪

158
00:09:44,360 --> 00:09:48,000
♪How to live without you♪

159
00:09:48,240 --> 00:09:52,400
♪I look up♪

160
00:09:52,400 --> 00:09:55,160
♪The starry sky♪

161
00:09:55,480 --> 00:09:58,960
♪So hazy and blurred♪
